0	section	Guards eviction dialogue
1	cond	If this is the first time being evicted by the guards:
2	box	A guard approaches you and pretends to start hitting you.
2	line	Mercenary	Take that you infidel!
2	box	The guard leans closer to you and says in a low voice.
2	line	Mercenary	We're sick of having to kill every lunatic that comes along and insults the captain, it makes such a mess. Thankfully, he's a bit decrepit so he doesn't notice so please, buzz off and don't come here again.
2	action	end
1	cond	If this is the second time being evicted by the guards:
2	box	The guard approaches you again and gives you a sharp kick.
2	line	Player	Ow!
2	line	Guard	Take that you mad child of a dog!
2	action	end
1	cond	If this is the third time being evicted by the guards:
2	box	A guard approaches you and looks very angry, he slaps you across the face.
2	line	Mercenary	Prepare to die effendi!
2	box	The guard leans close and whispers
2	line	Mercenary	Are you mad effendi? This is your last chance! Leave now and never come back or I'll introduce you to my friend.
2	box	The guard half draws his fearsome looking scimitar.
2	line	Mercenary	And we'll be pleased to clean the mess up after you've been dispatched.
2	action	end
1	cond	If this is the fourth or greater time being evicted by the guards:
2	box	An angry guard approaches you and whips out his sword.
2	line	Guard	Okay, that does it!
2	line	Guard	You're in serious trouble now!
2	line	Guard	Okay men, we need to teach this person a thing or two
2	line	Guard	about desert survival techniques.
2	box	The guards grab you and rough you up a bit.
2	box	You're grabbed and manhandled onto a cart.
2	box	Sometime later you're dumped in the middle of the desert.
2	line	Guard	You won't be needing that water anymore!
2	box	Guard: You won't be needing that water anymore!
2	box	The guards throw your water away.
2	box	The guards move off leaving you stranded in the desert.
2	action	end
