0	section	Talking to Male slave by the mine door entrance
1	line	Male slave	You look like a new 'recruit'. How long have you been here?
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	I've just arrived.
2	line	Player	I've just arrived.
2	line	Male slave	Yeah, it looks like it as well. It's a shame that I won't be around long enough to get to know you. I'm making a break for it today. I have a plan to get out of here! It's amazing in its sophistication.
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	What are those big wooden doors in the corner of the compound?
3	line	Player	What are those big wooden doors in the corner of the compound?
3	line	Male slave	They lead to an underground mine, but you really don't want to go down there.
3	line	Male slave	I've only seen slaves and guards go down there, I never see the slaves come back up. At least up here you have a nice view and a bit of sun. -- The slave smiles at you and goes back to his work. --
3	action	end
2	option	Oh yes, that sounds interesting.
3	line	Player	Oh yes, that sounds interesting.
3	line	Male slave	Yes, it is actually. I have all the details figured out except for one.
3	select	Select an Option
3	option	What's that then?
4	line	Player	What's that then?
4	line	Male slave	-- The slave rattles the chains on his arms loudly. -- These bracelets, I can't seem to get them off. If I could get them off, I'd be able to climb my way out of here.
4	select	Select an Option
4	option	I can try to undo them for you.
5	line	Player	I can try to undo them for you.
5	line	Male slave	Really, that would be great... -- The slave looks at you strangely. -- Hang on a minute... I suppose you want something for doing this?
5	line	Male slave	The last time I did a trade in this place, I nearly lost the shirt from my back!
5	select	Select an Option
5	option	It's funny you should say that...
6	line	Player	It's funny you should say that actually.
6	line	Male slave	-- The slave looks at you blankly. --
6	line	Male slave	Yeah, go on!
6	line	Player	If I can get the chains off, you have to give me something, okay?
6	line	Male slave	Sure, what do you want?
6	line	Player	I want your clothes!
6	line	Male slave	Blimey!
6	line	Player	I can dress like a slave and gain access to the mine area to scout it out.
6	line	Male slave	You're either incredibly brave or incredibly stupid. But what would I wear if you take my clothes? Get me some nice desert clothes and I'll think about it?
6	action	end
5	option	That sounds awful.
6	line	Player	That sounds awful.
6	line	Male slave	Yeah, bunch of no hopers, tried to rob me blind. But I guess that's what you get when you deal with convicts.
6	action	end
4	option	That's ridiculous, you're talking rubbish.
5	line	Player	That's ridiculous, you're talking rubbish.
5	line	Male slave	No, it's true, I can make a break for it If I can just get these bracelets off.
5	select	Select an Option
5	option	Good luck!
6	line	Player	Good luck!
6	line	Male slave	Thanks... same to you.
6	action	end
5	option	I can try to undo them for you.
6	action	above
3	option	Oh, that's a shame.
