4	line	Player	Still, 'worse things happen at sea right?'
4	line	Male slave	You've obviously never worked as a slave
4	line	Male slave	...in a mining camp...
4	line	Male slave	...in the middle of the desert.
4	line	Player	Well I suppose I'd better be getting on my way now...
4	line	Male slave	-- The slave nods in agreement and goes back to work. --
4	action	end
