0	section	Talking to the guard by the cave opening
1	box	This guard looks as if he's been down here a while.
1	line	Guard	Yeah, what do you want?
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Er nothing really.
2	line	Player	Er nothing really.
2	line	Guard	Okay... so move along and get on with your work.
2	action	end
1	option	I'd like to mine in a different area.
2	line	Player	I'd like to mine in a different area.
2	line	Guard	Oh, you want to work in another area of the mine eh? --The guard seems pleased with his rhetorical question.-- Well, I can understand that! A change is as good as a rest they say.
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	Huh, fat chance of a rest for me.
3	line	Player	Huh, fat chance of a rest for me.
