5	line	Ana	Well, we mine it in this section, then someone scoops it into a barrel. The barrels are loaded onto a mine cart. Then they're deposited near the surface lift.
5	line	Ana	I have no idea where they go from there. But that's not going to help us, is it?
5	select	Select an Option
5	option	Maybe? I'll come back to you when I have a plan.
6	line	Player	Maybe? I'll come back to you when I have a plan.
6	line	Ana	Okay, well, I'm not going anywhere! -- Ana nods at a nearby guard!-- Unless he feels generous enough to let me go! -- The guard ignores the comment. --
6	line	Ana	Oh well, I'd better get back to work, you take care!
6	action	end
5	option	Where would I get one of those barrels from?
6	line	Player	Where would I get one of those barrels from?
6	line	Ana	Well, you would get one from around by the lift area. But why would you want one of those?
6	select	Select an Option
6	option	Er no reason! Just wondering.
7	line	Player	Er no reason! Just wondering.
7	line	Ana	Hmmm, just don't get any funny ideas... I am not going to get into one of those barrels! Okay, have you got that?
7	select	Select an Option
7	option	Okay, yep, I've got that.
8	line	Player	Okay, yep, I've got that.
8	line	Ana	Good, just make sure you keep it in mind. Anyway, I have to get back to work. The guards will come along soon and give us some trouble else.
8	action	end
7	option	Well, we'll see, it might be the only way.
8	line	Player	Well, we'll see, it might be the only way.
8	line	Ana	No, there has to be a better way! Anyway, I have to get back to work. The guards will come along soon and give us some trouble else.
8	action	end
6	option	I could try to sneak you out if you were in a barrel!
7	line	Player	I could try to sneak you out if you were in a barrel!
7	line	Ana	There is no way you are getting me into a barrel. No WAY! DO you understand?
7	select	Select an Option
7	option	Okay, yep, I've got that.
8	action	above
7	option	Well, we'll see, it might be the only way.
8	action	above
1	option	What's your name.
2	line	Player	What's your name.
2	line	Ana	My name? Oh, how sweet, my name is Ana. I come from Al Kharid though we've only recently moved there. I was born, and did most of my growing up, in Varrock. I thought the desert might be interesting.
2	line	Ana	What a surprise I got!
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	What kind of surprise did you get?
3	line	Player	What kind of surprise did you get?
3	line	Ana	Well, I was just touring the desert looking for the nomad tribe to the West. And I was set upon by these armoured men.
3	line	Ana	I think that the guards think I am an escaped prisoner. They didn't understand that I was exploring the desert as an adventurer.
3	action	end
2	option	Do you want to go back to Al Kharid?
3	line	Player	Do you want to go back to Al Kharid?
3	line	Ana	Sure, I miss my Mum, her name is Irena and she is probably waiting for me. How do you propose we get out of here though?
3	line	Ana	I'm sure you've noticed the many square jawed guards around here. You look like you can handle yourself, but I have my doubts that you can take them all on!
3	action	end
